<title>GERMANY: German Sept capital account surplus narrows -Buba.</title>
<headline>German Sept capital account surplus narrows -Buba.</headline>
<dateline>FRANKFURT 1996-11-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>The German capital account surplus narrowed to a provisional 6.7 billion marks in September from 13.5 billion in August, the Bundesbank said.</p>
<p>For the first nine months of 1996, the surplus stood at 49.3 billion marks compared to 51.9 billion in the first nine months of 1995.</p>
<p>--Frankfurt Newsroom +49 69 756525</p>
